<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Internship Portal</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #FFFDD0;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .hero {
      background-color: #2D5016;
      color: #FFFDD0;
      padding: 80px 50px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn {
      background-color: #FFFDD0;
      color: #2D5016;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #e8e8e8;
    }
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 60px 50px;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background-color: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border-left: 4px solid #2D5016;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      color: #2D5016;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-size: 22px;
    }
    .feature-card p {
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('layouts/navbar') %>
  
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to Internship Portal</h1>
    <p>Connect with talented students. Find amazing internship opportunities.</p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="/auth/login" class="btn">Login</a>
      <a href="/auth/register/student" class="btn">Register as Student</a>
      <a href="/auth/register/org" class="btn">Register Organization</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>For Students</h3>
      <p>Browse internship opportunities, build your skills profile, and apply to roles that match your expertise. Track your applications and get accepted!</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>For Organizations</h3>
      <p>Post internship opportunities, review qualified candidates, and find the perfect interns for your team. Manage all applications in one place.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Skill-Based Matching</h3>
      <p>Students add their skills and proficiency levels. Organizations can find candidates with the exact expertise they need.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <%- include('layouts/footer') %>
</body>
</html>